<title>USA: Palm Harbor Q3 Dec 27 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Palm Harbor Q3 Dec 27 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PALM HARBOR HOMES INC</p>
<p>THIRD QUARTER ENDED			DEC 27,	   DEC 29,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales			     $150,796,000    $104,976,000</p>
<p> Net income				 6,019,000	 3,581,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			  0.40	    0.27/a</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  15,103,000    13,155,000/a</p>
<p>NINE MONTHS ENDED			   DEC 27,	   DEC 29,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales				424,248,000     306,989,000</p>
<p> Net income				17,784,000	10,634,000</p>
<p> Net income per share			1.22    $c	0.86/a</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding	  14,617,000    12,435,000/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Share and per share figures for the third quarter and nine months ended December 29, 1995 have been adjusted to reflect the 5-for-4 stock split distributed to shareholders on August 2, 1996.</p>
